From 14aa56fde3934fe5b561856994e799f9cb4b9299 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chaoso85 <216391968+chaoso85@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:00:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: msm8994: per-cluster PMUs; octagon: disable
 NFC (pn547)

Found by: reading the full-DT boot log (7.3-rc2 on the phone) end to end.
Two things the log showed that were not labelled as errors:

1. "Number of cores (8) exceeds configured maximum of 6 - clipping" and
   "CPU node for /cpus/cpu@102 exist but the possible cpu range is :0-5".
   The Lumia 950 XL (MSM8994) has 4xA53 + 4xA57; the config inherited from
   the Lumia 950 (MSM8992, 4xA53 + 2xA57) had CONFIG_NR_CPUS=6 so two A57
   cores were dropped (config change is in kernel/ztos-lumia.config).

2. Only one pmu node (cortex-a53-pmu, CPU mask 4) existed, so the A57
   cluster had no PMU. Split into pmu-a53 (cpu0-3) and pmu-a57 (cpu4-7)
   using interrupt-affinity.

NFC: the pn544 driver waited ~33 s for the nfc_en polarity (no back cover
= no antenna on the test unit) and blocked the I2C controller probe that
whole time. The node is disabled for now; remove status = "disabled" once
the cover is fitted.

(No reference project used; found on the phone.)

Signed-off-by: chaoso85 <216391968+chaoso85@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/msm8994-msft-lumia-octagon.dtsi     |  2 ++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994.dtsi                 | 11 +++++++++--
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994-msft-lumia-octagon.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994-msft-lumia-octagon.dtsi
index 5735d4f8d21..fccfeeefa7e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994-msft-lumia-octagon.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994-msft-lumia-octagon.dtsi
@@ -601,6 +601,8 @@ &blsp1_i2c6 {
 
 	pn547: pn547@28 {
 		compatible = "nxp,pn544-i2c";
+		/* back cover (NFC antenna) not fitted on the test unit; probe blocks ~33 s */
+		status = "disabled";
 
 		reg = <0x28>;
 
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994.dtsi
index fdbb6d69ef1..8e502903f7e 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/msm8994.dtsi
@@ -171,9 +171,16 @@ memory@80000000 {
 		reg = <0 0x80000000 0 0>;
 	};
 
-	pmu {
+	pmu-a53 {
 		compatible = "arm,cortex-a53-pmu";
-		interrupts = <GIC_PPI 7 (GIC_CPU_MASK_SIMPLE(4)| IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH)>;
+		interrupts = <GIC_PPI 7 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+		interrupt-affinity = <&cpu0>, <&cpu1>, <&cpu2>, <&cpu3>;
+	};
+
+	pmu-a57 {
+		compatible = "arm,cortex-a57-pmu";
+		interrupts = <GIC_PPI 7 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+		interrupt-affinity = <&cpu4>, <&cpu5>, <&cpu6>, <&cpu7>;
 	};
 
 	psci {
-- 
2.43.0

